I managed to reach well into XL13 on kills alone.

I had a blessed scroll of scare monster on the Mines
Town altar, co-aligned.

I had a ring of slow digestion, in fact, I had two.

I had enough bags of holding, I was using one for
Stash, one for Trash, and one for Goodies, and not
carrying any of them.

I played the last half of the game naked, at AC 1,
because dressed at AC -15 wasn't useful.

I had been crowned, and had been granted speed,
stealth, MagicBane, enough golden glows to put my
stats beyond belief.

A trip to Mine's End had provided a nice luckstone,
now blessed. Sokoban, one of my cleaner passes there,
where I invented a much nicer solution for one level,
