into holy water I cared to bother with, and blank
all the scrolls as well.

I'd learned maybe ten or eleven spells. Too much
knowledge is a bad thing, but Identify at 0% failure
was nice, with PW upwards of 175 last I noticed.

Mines Town, from one step out the door of the
Temple, was a mass of brown puddings wall to wall,
but that was a fraud, putting on a blindfold showed
one of the disadvantages of pools: lots and lots of
gremlins.

I had the stethoscope, the -3 dagger, 28 blessed
